---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Meeting Room">
  <Header lang="en" client:load />
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 text-center">
      <span class="text-brand-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-2 block">Events and Business</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-brand-text mb-6">Meeting Room</h2>
      <div class="text-left max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 text-center">
          We have a modern meeting room with capacity for up to 35 people, ideal for:
        </p>
        
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-brand-text-muted mb-8 list-disc list-inside px-4 md:px-12">
          <li>Corporate meetings</li>
          <li>Training sessions</li>
          <li>Workshops</li>
          <li>Job interviews</li>
          <li>Commercial presentations</li>
          <li>Board meetings</li>
          <li>Courses and seminars</li>
          <li>Coworking</li>
          <li>Institutional activities</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-brand-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 text-center">
          The room offers a beautiful view of the San Antonio Plaza and Church and direct access to a large terrace, providing a comfortable, bright, and professional environment.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10 px-4 md:px-0">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 md:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2">Available configurations</h3>
            <ul class="text-brand-text-muted space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>School-style setup</li>
              <li>Executive-style setup</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 md:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2">Equipment included</h3>
            <ul class="text-brand-text-muted space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>80-inch Smart TV</li>
              <li>HDMI connection</li>
              <li>High-speed WiFi internet</li>
              <li>Mineral water</li>
              <li>Printing, photocopying, and scanning service</li>
              <li>Personalized attention</li>
              <li>Adaptable furniture</li>
              <li>Rental by the hour or full day</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-primary/5 p-6 md:p-8 border-l-4 border-brand-primary">
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted mb-4">
            Guests staying at the hotel may request the use of the room for individual meetings or internal activities, subject to availability and prior coordination.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-text-muted font-medium">
            When the meeting includes external guests or requires a special setup, preferential rates will be offered for guests.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 mt-12">
        <div class="overflow-hidden h-64 md:h-80 relative group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-text/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10"></div>
          <img 
            src="/sala_reuniones/sala_reuniones1.avif" 
            alt="Meeting Room" 
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden h-64 md:h-80 relative group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-text/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10"></div>
          <img 
            src="/sala_reuniones/sala_reuniones2.avif" 
            alt="Corporate table" 
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden h-64 md:h-80 relative group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-text/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10"></div>
          <img 
            src="/sala_reuniones/sala_reuniones3.avif" 
            alt="Meeting room facilities" 
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden h-64 md:h-80 relative group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-text/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10"></div>
          <img 
            src="/sala_reuniones/sala_reuniones4.avif" 
            alt="Meeting room equipment" 
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>
